      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Pretty sure it has been mentioned before. Also considering it was only patched in 2018.4.27 even I forgot this was a problem because it took so long to be addressed. \nThere may be a couple of other smaller fixes that vrchat could benefit from too so if the team would like to spend a bit of time testing one of the latest LTS versions that would be appreciated. Although I don't expect much improvement it shouldn't be too painful to try as its the same 2018 LTS.",
      "viewerReactions": null
