      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2df15622470972dc58fcc7|full_name}: That's not something I can really answer. I have no idea what they are currently working on as their communication never includes upcoming things unless its something major that they want to tease. There could be a number of reasons why they never update to a newer LTS but we also don't even know if they have followed through with anything regarding this report.\nAlso considering there have been a lot of bigger bugs in the latest releases that surely has taken some time away from whatever plans they had. I'm less worried about the Unity version because there will eventually be a migration or update as there always has been and more so wondering why communication has stopped completely about the UI update.\nEnough of the community already gives them hell so please try to refrain from being so aggressive as they work through these issues.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
